[k8s.io] PodSandbox runtime should support metrics operations runtime should support listing pod sandbox metrics [Conformance]
    containerd reads a sandbox's metrics from the pod's cgroup parent, and
    critest gives the pod none when the engine uses cgroupfs, as here
    (common.GetCgroupParent). containerd logs "cgroupPath is empty" and leaves
    the pod out. A kubelet always sets one.
